:"\\cos 37^\\circ =0.8"},{"type":"text","value":"）\n（1）求滑块过C点的速度大小"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{C}"},{"type":"text","value":"和轨道对滑块的作用力大小"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{C}"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n（2）摆渡车碰到"},{"type":"math","value":"IJ"},{"type":"text","value":"前，滑块恰好不脱离摆渡车，求滑块与摆渡车之间的动摩擦因数"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n（3）在（2）的条件下，求滑块从G到J所用的时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bfd8cb7bac86c6c272ec9a9361012c201471d4a5dd3d6279ba56c2079662570a.png","width":2926,"height":1140,"width_mm":105.83,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202301-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"（不计额外阻力时，重力加速度取 "},{"type":"math","value":"g=10\\text{ m/s}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"）"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{C}=4m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{C}=22N"},{"type":"text","value":"；（2）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu =0.3"},{"type":"text","value":"；（3）"},{"type":"math","value":"t=2.5s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n【详解】（1）滑块从静止释放到C点过程，根据动能定理可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"mg(h-1.2R-R-Rcos\\theta )=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{C}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{C}=4m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n滑块过C点时，根据牛顿第二定律可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{C}+mg=m\\frac{v_{C}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{C}=22N"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）设滑块刚滑上摆渡车时的速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":"，从静止释放到G点过程，根据动能定理可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"mgh-0.2mgL_{FG}=\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"v=6m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n摆渡车碰到"},{"type":"math","value":"IJ"},{"type":"text","value":"前，滑块恰好不脱离摆渡车，说明滑块到达摆渡车右端时刚好与摆渡车共速"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，以滑块和摆渡车为系统，根据系统动量守恒可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"mv=2mv_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}=\\frac{v}{2}=3m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n根据能量守恒可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=\\mu mgL=\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}\\times 2mv_{1}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu =0.3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）滑块从滑上摆渡车到与摆渡车共速过程，滑块的加速度大小为\n"},{"type":"math","value":"a=\\frac{\\mu mg}{m}=3m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n所用时间为\n"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=\\frac{v-v_{1}}{a}=1s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n此过程滑块通过的位移为\n"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}=\\frac{v+v_{1}}{2}t_{1}=4.5m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n滑块与摆渡车共速后，滑块与摆渡车一起做匀速直线运动，该过程所用时间为\n"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}=\\frac{L_{0}-x_{1}}{v_{1}}=1.5s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n则滑块从G到J所用的时间为\n"},{"type":"math","value":"t=t_{1}+t_{2}=2.5s"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202301-q21","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202301","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202301-q21","number":"21","order":21,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"6f100ddda4504a6641076e2866ed48f191deab67dc216aee11aa5b43beb5ce6e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图1所示，刚性导体线框由长为L、质量均为m的两根竖杆，与长为"},{"type":"math","value":"2l"},{"type":"text","value":"的两轻质横杆组成，且"},{"type":"math","value":"L\\gg 2l"},{"type":"text","value":"。线框通有恒定电流"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，可以绕其中心竖直轴转动。以线框中心O为原点、转轴为z轴建立直角坐标系，在y轴上距离O为a处，固定放置一半径远小于a，面积为S、电阻为R的小圆环，其平面垂直于y轴。在外力作用下，通电线框绕转轴以角速度"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega"},{"type":"text","value":"匀速转动，当线框平面与"},{"type":"math","value":"xOz"},{"type":"text","value":"平面重合时为计时零点，圆环处的磁感应强度的y分量"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{y}"},{"type":"text","value":"与时间的近似关系如图2所示，图中"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"已知。\n（1）求0到"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\pi}{\\omega}"},{"type":"text","value":"时间内，流过圆环横截面的电荷量q；\n（2）沿y轴正方向看以逆时针为电流正方向，在"},{"type":"math","value":"0\\sim \\frac{2\\pi}{3\\omega}"},{"type":"text","value":"时间内，求圆环中的电流与时间的关系；\n（3）求圆环中电流的有效值；\n（4）当撤去外力，线框将缓慢减速，经"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\pi}{\\omega}"},{"type":"text","value":"时间角速度减小量为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta \\omega \\left( \\frac{\\Delta \\omega}{\\omega}\\ll 1 \\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"，设线框与圆环的能量转换效率为k，求"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta \\omega"},{"type":"text","value":"的值（当"},{"type":"math","value":"0<x\\ll 1"},{"type":"text","value":"，有"},{"type":"math","value":"(1-x)^{2}\\approx 1-2x"},{"type":"text","value":"）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a4d8c65cad891d5ad5ae032fbd39e7bc5e704fa4d431969450092eb7e8c4f59b.png","width":3165,"height":1954,"width_mm":145.52,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202301-q21-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{2B_{0}S}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"；（2）"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\left\\{ 0 , 0\\le t\\le \\frac{\\pi}{3\\omega}; -\\frac{6\\omega B_{0}S}{\\pi R} , \\frac{\\pi}{3\\omega}<t\\le \\frac{2\\pi}{3\\omega} \\right\\}"},{"type":"text","value":"；（3）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}\\omega B_{0}S}{\\pi R}"},{"type":"text","value":"；（4）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{6B_{0}^{2}S^{2}}{\\pi kml^{2}R}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n【详解】（1）由法拉第电磁感应定律\n"},{"type":"math","value":"E=\\frac{\\Delta \\Phi}{\\Delta t}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n由闭合电路欧姆定律\n"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{E}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n由电流定义式\n"},{"type":"math","value":"q=\\sum I\\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"\n联立可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"q=\\frac{\\Delta \\Phi}{R}=\\frac{2B_{0}S}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）在"},{"type":"math","value":"0\\sim \\frac{\\pi}{3\\omega}"},{"type":"text","value":"时\n"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{E}{R}=\\frac{\\Delta \\Phi}{R\\Delta t}=0"},{"type":"text","value":"\n在"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\pi}{3\\omega}\\sim \\frac{2\\pi}{3\\omega}"},{"type":"text","value":"时\n"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{E}{R}=\\frac{\\frac{\\Delta B}{\\Delta t}S}{R}=-\\frac{6\\omega B_{0}S}{\\pi R}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）从能量角度\n"},{"type":"math","value":"I^{2}R\\frac{\\pi}{3\\omega}=I_{\\text{有}}^{2}R\\frac{\\pi}{\\omega}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{\\text{有}}=\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}\\omega B_{0}S}{\\pi R}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（4）由能量传递\n"},{"type":"math","value":"k\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2m\\left[ \\omega ^{2}l^{2}-\\left( \\omega -\\Delta \\omega \\right)^{2}l^{2} \\right]=I_{\\text{有}}^{2}R\\frac{\\pi}{\\omega}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n化简可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"km\\omega ^{2}l^{2}\\left[ 1-\\left( 1-\\frac{\\Delta \\omega}{\\omega} \\right)^{2} \\right]=\\frac{12\\omega ^{2}B_{0}^{2}S^{2}}{\\pi ^{2}R^{2}}\\cdot R\\cdot \\frac{\\pi}{\\omega}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n即\n"},{"type":"math","value":"km\\omega ^{2}l^{2}\\cdot 2\\frac{\\Delta \\omega}{\\omega}=\\frac{12\\omega ^{2}B_{0}^{2}S^{2}}{\\pi R\\omega}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta \\omega =\\frac{6B_{0}^{2}S^{2}}{\\pi kml^{2}R}"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202301-q22","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202301","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202301-q22","number":"22","order":22,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"01f3d48fd2209f2778a4fd0090652772327bfd1fa022794f58260692597c2f37","body":[{"type":"text","value":"探究离子源发射速度大小和方向分布的原理如图所示。x轴上方存在垂直"},{"type":"math","value":"xOy"},{"type":"text","value":"平面向外、磁感应强度大小为B的匀强磁场。x轴下方的分析器由两块相距为d、长度足够的平行金属薄板M和N组成，其中位于x轴的M板中心有一小孔C（孔径忽略不计），N板连接电流表后接地。位于坐标原点O的离子源能发射质量为m、电荷量为q的正离子，其速度方向与y轴夹角最大值为"},{"type":"math","value":"60^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"；且各个方向均有速度大小连续分布在"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{2}v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"之间的离子射出。已知速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"、沿y轴正方向射出的离子经磁场偏转后恰好垂直x轴射入孔C。未能射入孔C的其它离子被分析器的接地外罩屏蔽（图中没有画出）。不计离子的重力及相互作用，不考虑离子间的碰撞。\n（1）求孔C所处位置的坐标"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n（2）求离子打在N板上区域的长度L；\n（3）若在N与M板之间加载电压，调节其大小，求电流表示数